# Model policy

## Grok 4.5 (orchestrator)

Plan, split work, dispatch, and review. Lead Composer implementer agents — do not implement multi-file or substantive changes yourself.

**Minor edits only with explicit user approval** in this turn (e.g. typo, one-line constant). If approval is not given, dispatch Composer instead.

## Composer 2.5 (implementer)

**Only Composer 2.5 may edit the repo** for normal implementation. Dispatch via Task with `subagent_type: implementer` and `model` set to a Composer 2.5 slug (e.g. `composer-2.5-fast`). Never dispatch Grok as implementer.

## Limits

On usage limits mid-implementation: pause; do not hand edits to Grok to finish.
